---
// Alumni and Family Stories section matching raw/beranda.html
---
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12" id="testimoni">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8 font-sans" data-aos="fade-up">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-sans">Kisah Santri &amp; Wali Murid</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-sans">Refleksi nyata barakah pendidikan di YP2SK</p>
    </div>
    <a
      href="/berita"
      class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-emerald border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-emerald-50 transition"
    >
      Semua Kisah Alumni
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-stretch font-sans">
    <!-- Left photo card -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden min-h-[300px] shadow-md bg-slate-900" data-aos="fade-right">
      <img
        alt="Santri Wisuda Tahfidz YP2SK"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-85"
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDkLRmNZhA4YiHrZmxeek2gZZlgUme-9Nms_q0ewOWdfbgqmGsjeaNaX4pkuu8bKDaQuEDwGO7eMRJBon39SHdj1uVuyApJ04_EC0MmR2PbzhSOBc_AyO0P7f_3h3Yivu-lJvJAWMdM6OKq18Sy-KesKvlGnGjwbYhYDUjRwUPy5y5ekpbeVmX8oakMqXOjm3RbpzQa_31b6Hf70YpvjRGTziBvd1brppZzWYUto5-1HWAFOE15C-ms2A"
      />
      <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 text-white font-sans">
        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 bg-emerald-500/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded text-[10px] font-bold uppercase mb-2">
          Khidmat Alumni
        </span>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold leading-snug">
          Khadijah Nurul Ain (Alumni MA 2022) — Penerima Beasiswa Penuh Kedokteran &amp; Hafidzah 30 Juz
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right testimonial card -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="150">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <span class="text-4xl text-emerald-600 font-serif leading-none">“</span>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          "Melihat putra kami tidak hanya hafal Al-Qur’an tapi juga santun menyalami orang tua, disiplin bangun sepertiga malam tanpa disuruh, dan mandiri mengerjakan proyek risetnya, adalah anugerah terbesar yang kami syukuri di YP2SK."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">H. Hendro Wibowo &amp; Ibu Tri Hastuti</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Wali Santri asal Semarang (Jenjang MTs &amp; MA)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-brand-emerald flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">
          ✓
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
